		# Arbol explicado: que da cada tecnologia y que es en el mundo
		"LBL_TECH_INTRO": "Research PERMANENT advantages here. Each one costs resources and time, and only one is researched at a time. Three branches (Industrial, Military, Logistics) of five tiers, in order: tier 2 needs tier 1.\nIn the world: the Regency wrote us off and took the blueprints with it. This is what the Written-Off reinvent on their own.",
